course: dictionary
lesson: 10706
title: Unsure: not certain
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Unsure means not certain, or not confident about something. If you do not know the answer for sure, you are unsure. In «I'm unsure of the answer», the speaker is saying they do not know for certain.
explain: Read the words around unsure to see how it is used. In «She gave an unsure smile», the smile is about feelings: she is nervous and not sure how people will react. Phrases help too: unsure of, unsure about and unsure whether all show that something is not clear to you.
explain: Being unsure is often sensible. «Being unsure is often the most honest place to be» means it is honest to admit you do not know yet. When you are unsure, ask a trusted adult, check a dictionary, or say «I'm not sure, but I think…».
fact: Unsure means not certain or not confident about something.
fact: «Unsure of» is followed by a thing: «I'm unsure of the answer».
fact: «Unsure whether» is followed by a choice: «I'm unsure whether it is safe».
fact: Unsure of yourself means you do not feel confident in yourself.
fact: If you are unsure whether something is safe, stop and ask a trusted adult.
exercise: «I'm unsure of the answer, so I will check the dictionary.» What does unsure mean here? | Very angry | Completely finished | *Not certain | Good at maths
exercise: «She gave an unsure smile when the teacher called her name.» What does the smile show? | Anger at the teacher | Happiness and pride | *Nervousness, not being sure how to feel | Boredom
exercise: Which phrase means you do not feel confident in yourself? | Proud of yourself | Sure of yourself | *Unsure of yourself | Tired of yourself
test: «Being unsure is often the most honest place to be.» Why might being unsure be called honest? | You pretend to know everything | You are shouting loudly | You change your answer every minute | *You admit you do not know for sure yet
test: You see a link online and you are unsure whether it is safe. What should you do? | Ignore your feeling and keep going | Share it with your friends | Click it quickly to find out | *Stop and ask a trusted adult
exam: Which sentence shows that someone is not certain? | *He was unsure about the road home | The lamp was bright and warm | She was certain of every answer | They were completely finished
